":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["dengzhang-q-494c7e1af58f1307a208"]},"ordering_evidence":"dengzhang-q-494c7e1af58f1307a208","source_order":[45,344,183],"order":7973},{"id":"dengzhang-e-o168","title":"李邈非亮被诛","accounts":[{"id":"dengzhang-a-c52ee995687b7575b90b","label":"裴注·华阳国志","text":"李邈非亮被诛","evidence":["dengzhang-q-88480664d55464ad1b30"]}],"participants":[{"person":"dengzhang-p0030","role":"亮卒后上疏曰吕禄霍禹未必怀反叛之心，亮身仗强兵狼顾虎视，今亮殒没盖宗族得全","evidence":["dengzhang-q-88480664d55464ad1b30"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0112","role":"怒，下狱诛李邈","evidence":["dengzhang-q-88480664d55464ad1b30"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["dengzhang-q-88480664d55464ad1b30"]},"ordering_evidence":"dengzhang-q-88480664d55464ad1b30","source_order":[45,344,231],"order":7974}],"persons":[{"id":"dengzhang-p0030","name":"李邈","evidence":["dengzhang-q-903ca565d3a6d0af9996","dengzhang-q-ce4a3d5018a2bdb37599","dengzhang-q-494c7e1af58f1307a208","dengzhang-q-88480664d55464ad1b30","dengzhang-q2-d388a3cda024f57b10fb","dengzhang-q2-3c7b71142af6526481f2"],"facts":[{"id":"dengzhang-f2-bf1b81705316f0dad02e","text":"李邈在刘璋时为牛鞞长，后为犍为太守、丞相参军、安汉将军。","evidence":["dengzhang-q2-d388a3cda024f57b10fb","dengzhang-q2-3c7b71142af6526481f2"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dengzhang-q-494c7e1af58f1307a208","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-3553154601c3ee84933d","layer":"pei","quote":"邈谏以‘秦赦孟明，用伯西戎；楚诛子玉，二世不竞’。失亮意，还蜀","attribution":"裴注·华阳国志","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":343,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-dbd38a35de422f1d27d6","start":183,"end":214},{"id":"dengzhang-q-88480664d55464ad1b30","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-3553154601c3ee84933d","layer":"pei","quote":"邈上疏曰：‘吕禄、霍禹未必怀反叛之心，孝宣不好为杀臣之君；直以臣惧其逼，主畏其威，故奸萌生。亮身仗强兵，狼顾虎视；五大不在边，臣常危之。今亮殒没，盖宗族得全；西戎静息，大小为庆。’后主怒，下狱诛之","attribution":"裴注·华阳国志","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":343,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-dbd38a35de422f1d27d6","start":231,"end":329},{"id":"dengzhang-q-903ca565d3a6d0af9996","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-3553154601c3ee84933d","layer":"pei","quote":"先主领牧，为从事。正旦，命行酒，得进见，让先主曰：‘振威以将军宗室肺腑，委以讨贼；元功未效，先寇而灭。邈以将军之取鄙州，甚为不宜也！’先主曰：‘知其不宜，何以不助之？’邈曰：‘匪不敢也，力不足耳！’","attribution":"裴注·华阳国志","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":343,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-dbd38a35de422f1d27d6","start":28,"end":127},{"id":"dengzhang-q-ce4a3d5018a2bdb37599","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-3553154601c3ee84933d","layer":"pei","quote":"有司将杀之，诸葛亮为请，得免","attribution":"裴注·华阳国志","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":343,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-dbd38a35de422f1d27d6","start":127,"end":141},{"id":"dengzhang-q2-3c7b71142af6526481f2","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-3553154601c3ee84933d","layer":"pei","quote":"邵兄邈，字汉南。刘璋时为牛鞞长。","attribution":"裴注（引书见原文）","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":343,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-dbd38a35de422f1d27d6","start":12,"end":28},{"id":"dengzhang-q2-d388a3cda024f57b10fb","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-3553154601c3ee84933d","layer":"pei","quote":"久之，为犍为太守。丞相参军，安汉将军。","attribution":"裴注（引书见原文）","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":343,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-dbd38a35de422f1d27d6","start":142,"end":161}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
